  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; line-height: 21.3333px;\">La Asociaci&oacute;n Onda Centre Comercial, en esta Fira 2015 (en la foto de archivo la inauguraci&oacute;n del a&ntilde;o pasado y en la galer&iacute;a de abajo 72 im&aacute;genes de ese mismo d&iacute;a), va a continuar reservando entradas para la feria de atracciones para sus clientes al precio de 10 &euro; / 10 entradas. El &uacute;ltimo d&iacute;a para reservarlas ser&aacute; el viernes 2 de octubre.</span></span></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugfiraatraccionsfira14/img_8271.jpg\" alt=\"img_8271\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugfiraatraccionsfira14/img_8272.jpg\" alt=\"img_8272\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugfiraatraccionsfira14/img_8273.jpg\" alt=\"img_8273\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugfiraatraccionsfira14/img_8274.jpg\" alt=\"img_8274\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugfiraatraccionsfira14/img_8275.jpg\" alt=\"img_8275\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugfiraatraccionsfira14/img_8276.jpg\" alt=\"img_8276\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugfiraatraccionsfira14/img_8278.jpg\" alt=\"img_8278\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugfiraatraccionsfira14/img_8279.jpg\" alt=\"img_8279\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugfiraat